Package: ipedstidy
Type: Package
Title: Search, Download, and Tidy Multi-Year IPEDS Data by Variable and Institution
Version: 0.1.1
Author: Sheryl Liu
Maintainer: Sheryl Liu <sherylliu2018@gmail.com>
Description: Tools to search IPEDS (Integrated Postsecondary Education Data System)
    variable definitions across collection years (2004-05 onward), download only the
    specific survey tables a request needs, filter institutions by characteristics
    (state, sector, level, Carnegie class, etc.), and assemble everything into one
    tidy multi-year data frame keyed by UNITID and year. Built so that pulling IPEDS
    data never requires manually clicking through the IPEDS Data Center website.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
